{"dur": 27.69, "fps": 30, "segments": [{"id": "hook", "text": "Ce tableau, personne ne le regarde.", "t0": 1.2, "t1": 3.447, "words": [{"w": "Ce", "t": 1.2}, {"w": "tableau,", "t": 1.398}, {"w": "personne", "t": 1.927}, {"w": "ne", "t": 2.522}, {"w": "le", "t": 2.72}, {"w": "regarde.", "t": 2.918}]}, {"id": "suspense", "text": "Et pourtant, c'est lui qui part à l'atelier.", "t0": 4.247, "t1": 6.732, "words": [{"w": "Et", "t": 4.247}, {"w": "pourtant,", "t": 4.42}, {"w": "c'est", "t": 4.94}, {"w": "lui", "t": 5.287}, {"w": "qui", "t": 5.518}, {"w": "part", "t": 5.75}, {"w": "à", "t": 6.038}, {"w": "l'atelier.", "t": 6.154}]}, {"id": "role", "text": "Le ferrailleur ne voit jamais ta poutre. Il ne voit que des repères et des longueurs.", "t0": 7.112, "t1": 11.755, "words": [{"w": "Le", "t": 7.112}, {"w": "ferrailleur", "t": 7.278}, {"w": "ne", "t": 7.941}, {"w": "voit", "t": 8.107}, {"w": "jamais", "t": 8.383}, {"w": "ta", "t": 8.77}, {"w": "poutre.", "t": 8.936}, {"w": "Il", "t": 9.323}, {"w": "ne", "t": 9.489}, {"w": "voit", "t": 9.655}, {"w": "que", "t": 9.931}, {"w": "des", "t": 10.152}, {"w": "repères", "t": 10.373}, {"w": "et", "t": 10.816}, {"w": "des", "t": 10.982}, {"w": "longueurs.", "t": 11.203}]}, {"id": "risque", "text": "Un repère en double, un total faux… et c'est le chantier qui s'arrête.", "t0": 12.135, "t1": 16.094, "words": [{"w": "Un", "t": 12.135}, {"w": "repère", "t": 12.296}, {"w": "en", "t": 12.67}, {"w": "double,", "t": 12.831}, {"w": "un", "t": 13.205}, {"w": "total", "t": 13.366}, {"w": "faux…", "t": 13.687}, {"w": "et", "t": 14.275}, {"w": "c'est", "t": 14.436}, {"w": "le", "t": 14.757}, {"w": "chantier", "t": 14.917}, {"w": "qui", "t": 15.399}, {"w": "s'arrête.", "t": 15.613}]}, {"id": "civrebar", "text": "CivRebar AI génère la nomenclature avec le dessin. Les deux restent d'accord.", "t0": 16.474, "t1": 22.14, "words": [{"w": "CivRebar", "t": 16.474}, {"w": "AI", "t": 17.145}, {"w": "génère", "t": 17.369}, {"w": "la", "t": 17.891}, {"w": "